The [[Shovel]] is a [[weapon]] obtainable by combining the [[Broom]] and [[Pan]], which are both common items available in the shop to all characters, reasonably obtainable as early as round 1. It deals better DPS than the Broom, with the the same {{icon/blind}} on hit effect, but higher chance. It also uses less stamina than the [[Pan]], but does less damage.

Whenever the shop is entered, the [[Shovel]] digs up an item, which can be a wide range of items, but mainly cheap (<3 {{icon/gold}}) common items available in the shop, including the normally unobtainable [[gemstone]]s (mostly chipped). With the [[Dig Deeper]] skill, the [[Shovel]] can dig up much more valuable items. Regardless of what is dug up, the shovel slowly accumulates {{icon/gold}} value of items over time, which helps with economy.

The [[Shovel]] can be crafted with the [[Resistor]] (Which is an [[Engineer]] shop item) to create the [[Shovel B01-3000]], which isn't a weapon at all, but rather a pet which gains {{icon/luck}} and {{icon/heat}}, and performs better when charged. The [[Shovel B01-3000]] also retains the [[Shovel]]'s ability to dig up items.

